v1.0.55 build 78: revamp Settings screen with 100% interactive Apple HIG & zero dead chevrons

- settings_screen.dart: created dedicated modular SettingsScreen adhering strictly
  to Apple HIG (iOS 18) grouped list standards.
- Zero dead chevrons: every row with a chevron ('>') is fully interactive and opens
  a dedicated Cupertino modal sheet or action sheet; purely informational rows (Status,
  Terakhir Sinkron) use status pills/clean values without misleading chevrons.
- Fixed text truncation: eliminated horizontal collisions (Status Si..., Script Ba...)
  by utilizing proper subtitles and flexible badges.
- Features wired:
  * Antrean Offline: opens queue inspector sheet showing pending items & sync state.
  * Panduan Setup: opens step-by-step Google Apps Script deployment walkthrough.
  * File Backend: copy button copies filename with iOS Dynamic Island-style floating pill toast.
  * Statistik Database: queries SQLite database and displays live counts for costumes, rentals,
    customers, and installment logs.
  * Bersihkan Cache: CupertinoActionSheet confirmation to clean temporary thumbnails safely.
  * Tentang Aplikasi & Design System & Catatan Rilis: comprehensive Apple HIG detail sheets.
- main_scaffold.dart: removed hardcoded 250-line embedded settings tab and wired SettingsScreen.
- db_helper.dart: added getTableCounts() for instant database stats.